  thermoPhysPropDict (v2) -- phi-phi on PC-SAFT.  Whether the association
  term is active is decided by the FACTS on the component records (the
  resolver posture): both records here carry the association trio, so the
  engine announces the roster; a record without one is simply
  non-associating, exactly the pre-association behaviour.
\*---------------------------------------------------------------------------*/

recordType    thermophysicalPropertySystem;
schemaVersion 2;

components ( water ethanol );

equilibrium
{
    formulation phiPhi;
    equationOfState { model PCSAFT; }
}
